{
  "episode_id": "ep00_introduction",
  "title": "Wait, Listen to Me",
  "total_duration": 112.0,
  "language": "en",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.8,
      "text": "Wait, wait, wait—listen to me.",
      "emphasis": ["Wait, wait, wait"],
      "style": "urgent"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 1.8,
      "end": 3.5,
      "text": "Please stop scrolling for literally two seconds.",
      "emphasis": ["literally two seconds"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 3.8,
      "end": 5.8,
      "text": "It looks like an angry ginger root.",
      "emphasis": ["ginger root"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 8.5,
      "text": "Hi. I’m Nemi. I’m 24.",
      "emphasis": ["Nemi", "24"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 8.5,
      "end": 12.0,
      "text": "And apparently... I am making animated YouTube videos now.",
      "emphasis": ["animated YouTube videos"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 17.0,
      "text": "I’ve spent years watching storytime creators talk about their lives...",
      "emphasis": [],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 17.2,
      "end": 19.8,
      "text": "\"How hard could that possibly be?\"",
      "emphasis": ["How hard"],
      "style": "smug"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "As it turns out: extraordinarily hard.",
      "emphasis": ["extraordinarily hard"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 30.0,
      "text": "Nobody warns you that 24 frames a second means twenty-four chances to humiliate yourself.",
      "emphasis": ["twenty-four chances to humiliate yourself"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 30.5,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "I spent four hours yesterday inbetweening an arm movement...",
      "emphasis": ["four hours"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 38.5,
      "text": "It looked like slipping on three invisible banana peels.",
      "emphasis": ["three invisible banana peels"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 39.5,
      "end": 40.8,
      "text": "...In slow motion.",
      "emphasis": [],
      "style": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "Normally, when I’m not breaking my wrist, I have a disciplined routine.",
      "emphasis": [],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 53.5,
      "text": "I walk into the gym like an anime hero... and leave paralyzed by leg day.",
      "emphasis": ["paralyzed"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 54.5,
      "end": 59.8,
      "text": "\"Just one episode before bed,\" and suddenly birds are chirping.",
      "emphasis": ["birds are chirping"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 60.5,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "A mail carrier heard me hit a high note with absolute vibrato.",
      "emphasis": ["absolute vibrato"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 64.5,
      "end": 71.0,
      "text": "I have all these weird situations in my life, and keeping them inside feels dangerous.",
      "emphasis": ["dangerous"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 71.5,
      "end": 76.8,
      "text": "I spent six entire hours researching the structural tension of Victorian bridges...",
      "emphasis": ["six entire hours"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "...to draw one background that is on screen for half a second.",
      "emphasis": ["half a second"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 82.5,
      "text": "Half. A. Second.",
      "emphasis": ["Half.", "A.", "Second."],
      "style": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 88.0,
      "text": "My posture was ruined. But the bridge was architecturally sound.",
      "emphasis": ["architecturally sound"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 88.5,
      "end": 96.5,
      "text": "Stories about awkward encounters, creative rabbit holes, and gym blunders.",
      "emphasis": [],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 97.0,
      "end": 103.5,
      "text": "I want to have fun with it, get better at animation, and meet cool people.",
      "emphasis": ["cool people"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 107.5,
      "text": "If that sounds like something you’d enjoy... I’d love it if you stayed.",
      "emphasis": ["stayed"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 110.5,
      "text": "Also—straighten your posture right now. Yes, you.",
      "emphasis": ["straighten your posture"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 110.5,
      "end": 112.5,
      "text": "Thank you for watching my very first video. Bye!",
      "emphasis": ["first video", "Bye!"],
      "style": "standard"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 113.5,
      "end": 116.0,
      "text": "Wait—did I leave the microphone gain at 200%?!",
      "emphasis": ["200%?!"],
      "style": "panic"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 118.2,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "...It was. Cool.",
      "emphasis": [],
      "style": "deadpan"
    }
  ]
}
